  "steps": [
    "Soak the bags with ground meat and butter in boiling water for five minutes.",
    "Add eggs, grated potato, parsley and mozzarella to all the bags.",
    "Put red bell pepper, carrot, zucchini and fried bacon into separate bags.",
    "Mix the contents of each bag, divide into equal pieces and freeze for three hours.",
    "Cut pieces and peel off the film from the slices.",
    "Place on a baking tray and bake for 45 minutes."
